OL,3,GNEWSARoads closed as crews battle city
OL,4,Acentre blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a large blaze
OL,7,Fthat has forced road closures and is
OL,8,Fsending plumes of thick smoke into the
OL,9,Fsky above Birmingham city centre.
OL,11,FA number of crews have been called to
OL,12,FGreat Hampton Street, near the city's
OL,13,FJewellery Quarter, West Midlands Fire
OL,14,FService (WMFS) said.
OL,16,FThe road is closed as well as a number
OL,17,Fnearby, including Barr Street and
OL,18,FConstitution Hill between Northwood
OL,19,FStreet and Halford Street.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
