OL,3,GNEWSARoads closed as crews battle city
OL,4,Acentre blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public has been urged by WMFS to
OL,7,Favoid the area and warned them not to
OL,8,Ffly drones nearby as a fire service
OL,9,Fdrone was in operation and others being
OL,10,Fused in the area could hamper work to
OL,11,Fbring the blaze under control.
